    "updated_at": "2022-10-07T13:33:50Z",
    "body": "From a purely personal perspective, I like that I can \"escape\" a page where a modal dialog hasn't quite been marked up correctly by tabbing out to the address bar. I really dislike it when the focus is trapped in a specific area. With ARIA menus, for example, my JAWS focus can get trapped within the menu until I make a selection, when sometimes I just want to back out without doing anything. Makes me feel as though I'm caught in a mouse trap :-(",
