    "updated_at": "2023-11-22T12:31:10Z",
    "body": "It _sounds_ like most people are in agreement that the current functionality is correct so I think we can just close this. Maybe there is a opportunity to make this position more clear in the spec?\r\n\r\nIn any case I really appreciate everyones time to make comments and share their thoughts ❤️ I haven't done a lot of spec work and it can be a bit daunting but everyone has been super nice.",
